'''Remote Perk Shop''' is a {{Special}} item purchasable from [[Kuudra#Perk Shop|Kuudra Perk Shop]] for {{c|100000}}. As the name suggests, it allows the player to access the Perk Shop remotely. It stays with the player after the Kuudra run is over.

== Interface ==
{{:Kuudra/UI}}

== Trivia ==
*You must have the coins in your bank to purchase this item. It will not take the coins from your purse.
**As the Personal Bank is disabled inside Kuudra's Hollow, if you didn't have enough coins in your bank, you have to leave and rejoin to purchase the item.
*When bought it is renamed to {{Rarity|s|Open Shop}}

